{
  "type": "html",
  "title": "多处理机系统架构可视化",
  "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5}.container{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h1{color:#333}.section{margin:20px 0}canvas{border:1px solid #ccc;display:block;margin:0 auto}button{padding:8px 16px;margin:5px}.info{background:#fff;border-radius:5px;padding:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><h1>多处理机系统架构</h1><div class=\"info\">本动画演示三种多处理机系统类型及其特点：<br>• <b>紧密耦合</b>：共享内存+总线/交叉开关互联<br>• <b>松散耦合</b>：独立OS+通道/通信线路互联<br>• <b>SMP</b>：对称式多处理器（相同CPU）<br>• <b>ASMP</b>：非对称式多处理器（主从结构）</div><canvas id=\"canvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></canvas><div style=\"text-align:center\"><button onclick=\"showTight()\">紧密耦合</button><button onclick=\"showLoose()\">松散耦合</button><button onclick=\"toggleAuto()\">自动演示</button></div><script>const canvas=document.getElementById('canvas');const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');let currentType='tight';let animFrame;function drawSystem(type){ctx.clearRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);if(type==='tight')drawTight();else if(type==='loose')drawLoose();else drawAll();}function drawTight(){// 绘制共享内存块ctx.fillStyle='#aaddff';ctx.fillRect(100,150,200,80);ctx.strokeStyle='#333';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.strokeRect(100,150,200,80);// 绘制总线连接线ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(150,175);ctx.lineTo(250,175);ctx.stroke();// CPU标注ctx.fillStyle='#333';ctx.font='14px Arial';ctx.fillText('CPU A',120,140);ctx.fillText('CPU B',320,140);ctx.fillText('共享内存',150,200);}function drawLoose(){// 独立处理器ctx.fillStyle='#ddaaee';ctx.fillRect(100,150,200,80);ctx.strokeStyle='#333';ctx.strokeRect(100,150,200,80);// 通信线路ctx.beginPath();ctx.setLineDash([5,5]);ctx.moveTo(150,175);ctx.lineTo(250,175);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);// OS标注ctx.fillStyle='#333';ctx.font='14px Arial';ctx.fillText('OS A',120,140);ctx.fillText('OS B',320,140);ctx.fillText('独立OS',150,200);}function drawAll(){drawTight();drawLoose();}function showTight(){currentType='tight';drawSystem('tight');}function showLoose(){currentType='loose';drawSystem('loose');}function toggleAuto(){if(animFrame)cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);const types=['tight','loose'];let i=0;function loop(){i=(i+1)%types.length;currentType=types[i];drawSystem(types[i]);animFrame=requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();}window.onload=()=>drawSystem('tight');</script></div></body></html>",
  "description": "该动画通过对比展示紧密耦合与松散耦合两种多处理机系统架构，并标注关键组件（如共享内存、独立OS）。支持手动切换视图及自动轮播演示，帮助理解不同耦合方式的特点。",
  "knowledge_base_quote": [
    "源于教材知识库：《操作系统》多处理机系统的引入与类型",
    "引入多处理机系统的主要原因：解决CPU时钟频率极限、增加系统吞吐量、节省投资、提高系统可靠性。"
  ],
  "subtype": "animation"
}